      "text": "Sherem confessed Christ, Jacob 7:17. every nation shall confess before God that his judgments are just, Mosiah 16:1. the Lord will confess he never knew those who never knew him, Mosiah 26:27 (Matt. 7:23). every tongue shall confess before the Redeemer, Mosiah 27:31. if a man is meek and confesses Christ, he must have charity, Moro. 7:44.",
